OL,3,AHundreds evacuated from
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky during rare
OL,5,AUkraine ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of residents of the devastated
OL,8,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,9,Fbeen evacuated, Russian and Ukrainian
OL,10,Fauthorities have said, following a
OL,11,Fhumanitarian ceasefire brokered by US
OL,12,FFirst Lady Melania Trump.
OL,14,F"Everything unfolded without any
OL,15,Fincidents, and both sides noted the
OL,16,Fhigh level of organisation," Russia's
OL,17,Fhuman rights ombudsman Yana Lantratova
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,FUkrainian authorities confirmed the
OL,21,Fevacuees will travel to southern Russia
OL,22,Fand then on to Ukraine through Belarus.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
