OL,3,AHundreds evacuated from
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky during rare
OL,5,AUkraine ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FMelania Trump said that "all elements
OL,8,Fof the convoy, including the safe
OL,9,Fpassageway in and out of Oleshky, was
OL,10,Festablished through mutual agreement
OL,11,Fbetween Russian and Ukrainian leaders".
